member.summary:
Explicit-register command registry.  Commands are registered by calling
 with a  instance;
a source-generator upgrade is planned for v2 but is not required at v1.

Bootstraps a Phoenixml application.  Every app's Main is roughly ten lines:

var builder = PhoenixmlAppBuilder.Create("MyApp", args);
builder.Services.AddSingleton<IMyService, MyService>();
builder.Commands.Register(new RegisteredCommand("file.open", …));
var host = builder.Build();
await host.RunAsync();

member.returns:
 if this is the first instance (or if single-instance
detection could not be established — degrade gracefully);
 if a second instance forwarded its arguments to the first.

member.summary:
Application shell window. Provides custom title-bar chrome (per
), a content slot apps inject their content into,
and a composable status bar.

Gets or sets the split orientation.
 = panes side-by-side;
 = panes top/bottom.
